;
; How Homestead files one step of a scene in MYRA (homestead_rules.h HR6):
; the scene's number, the device the step sets and the setpoint it sets,
; in the device's own unit. Each step still passes device_cmd_ok when
; the scene runs.
^ZXSCENE(scene:i3, device:i4) = setpoint:i5!
